# Who must review what. In this exercise repo there is one collaborator, so required
# reviews are not enforced in branch protection — the file records the intent that
# ai_guardrail.md and runbook.md describe, and is what you would turn on in the real
# service repo.

# The workload itself: the service owner.
/k8s/                       @yurictl

# The guardrail, its policy and the pipeline: service owner AND someone from the SRE
# rota. Loosening a threshold is a change to the safety envelope, not a config tweak.
/solution/policy/           @yurictl
/solution/scripts/          @yurictl
/.github/workflows/         @yurictl

# Exception records: never self-approved. See solution/exceptions/README.md.
/solution/exceptions/       @yurictl
